#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 45(1)(b) refusal, restriction, suspension or withdrawal of a certificate or approval` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 45(1)(c) circumstances affecting the scope of or conditions for notification` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Item (c): the event has occurred.
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 45(1)(c) circumstances affecting the scope of or conditions for notification` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 45(1)(c) circumstances affecting the scope of or conditions for notification` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 45(1)(d) a request for information from a market surveillance authority` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Item (d): the event has occurred.
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 45(1)(d) a request for information from a market surveillance authority` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 45(1)(d) a request for information from a market surveillance authority` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 45(1) the notified body must inform the notifying authority of the item` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 45(1)(e) conformity assessment activities performed and any other activity, on request` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
