-- Positive results without a request (fork F-45-1-e).
#ASSERT `Art 45(3) the notified body must provide the other notified body with relevant information on the kind of results` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 45(3) positive conformity assessment results, on request` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not a similar notified body: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 45(3) the notified body must provide the other notified body with relevant information on the kind of results` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 45(3) positive conformity assessment results, on request` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
