#ASSERT `Art 46(2) the law-enforcement or civil protection authority may put a specific high-risk AI system into service without the authorisation` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application of Chapter III and not significantly changed: saved (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 46(2) the law-enforcement or civil protection authority may put a specific high-risk AI system into service without the authorisation` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Significantly changed: covered.
#ASSERT `Art 46(2) the law-enforcement or civil protection authority may put a specific high-risk AI system into service without the authorisation` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
